316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E (    The body is not merely a vessel for the mind but an integral component of cognition itself. Thoughts, emotions, and decisions are shaped by bodily states, sensory experiences, and physical movements. Memory, perception, and reasoning are all embodied processes.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
